column1:
After a blow up at last week ’ s City Council meeting over the proposal to discuss having a Police Chief, St. Louis fired his Police Chief. City Councillor Andrew Gounardes said;

“I think it is a matter of time before we go through another round of civil unrest.”

The news that the St. Louis Fire Chief has been hired as the next Police Chief is just one example of how badly our police and fire departments are being mismanaged by Mayor Slay and his cronies. This is the same St. Louis that had to be bailed out by the Federal Government.|0
